====== NETGEAR WAC124 ======

Netgear advertise this product as a standalone access point.  However, it also offers router functions. Includes 5x Gigabit Ethernet Ports (4x LAN, 1x WAN), 1x USB 2.0, WPS, and dual band 802.11bgn (2.4 GHz)/802.11ac (2.4GHz and 5GHz) WiFi with combined throughput of 2Gbps (AC2000 rated).

