==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

Remove the three screws from the bottom of the case using a Torx T10 driver.  One screw is located near the USB port, and the other two are underneath the front two rubber feet.

Next, pry open the case from the sides.  There are molded latches on all four sides; they are very tight so most likely you will break at least one in the process.

